    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/bd29fb21e5c213a601a2fcccead8fb4a.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/bd29fb21e5c213a601a2fcccead8fb4a.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/bd29fb21e5c213a601a2fcccead8fb4a.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to Fracctal Monsters, the ultimate monster taming experience that takes pet care and real-time combat to a whole new level!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/f6e89e62bc5528816cb35575c3c9eadc.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/f6e89e62bc5528816cb35575c3c9eadc.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/f6e89e62bc5528816cb35575c3c9eadc.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on an exciting journey filled with online exploration, immersive training, adrenaline-pumping 2D action-based platformer combat, and intense PvP battles where you'll face off against other players for epic loot and bragging rights.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/b90b403032eb99925777baa6c22e07de.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/b90b403032eb99925777baa6c22e07de.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/b90b403032eb99925777baa6c22e07de.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Fracctal Monsters, every virtual pet is more than just a creature \u2013 they're your loyal companions with unique personalities, distinct hobbies, specific diets, and individual preferences. Each monster offers a one-of-a-kind bond and interaction that will keep you coming back for more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/4e06c49d9483d7a39554a2bc95ce94e0.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/4e06c49d9483d7a39554a2bc95ce94e0.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/4e06c49d9483d7a39554a2bc95ce94e0.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore a vibrant, living world where you can discover hidden secrets and participate in thrilling challenges. Obtain new monsters by opening packs or winning them in various in-game challenges. The expansive world of Fracctal Monsters is teeming with adventures that challenge your skills and strategic thinking.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/69569d560ec5e7c7c9d524b560a1152b.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/69569d560ec5e7c7c9d524b560a1152b.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/69569d560ec5e7c7c9d524b560a1152b.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Raise and evolve your monsters by engaging them in training modes, keeping them happy, and feeding them their preferred diets. Watch as they grow stronger, learn new abilities, and transform into even more powerful forms. The evolution system allows for deep customization and personal connection with your monsters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/cbdbac3eb482d9d040582889f0fcb0d6.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/cbdbac3eb482d9d040582889f0fcb0d6.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/cbdbac3eb482d9d040582889f0fcb0d6.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Prepare for epic boss battles that test the limits of your monster's strength and strategy. Team up with other players or go solo to take down formidable foes and earn exclusive rewards. Each boss encounter is a challenge that requires tactical planning and skillful execution.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/0158eca48558c55b42c0a1d929a08a15.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/0158eca48558c55b42c0a1d929a08a15.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/0158eca48558c55b42c0a1d929a08a15.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With a vast world to explore, countless challenges to overcome, and a thriving community of fellow tamers, Fracctal Monsters promises endless hours of fun, excitement, and adventure. So, are you ready to dive into the captivating world of monster taming and unleash the power of your Fracctal Monsters? Join us now and embark on an unforgettable journey like no other!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/57e0746bd0544170b7a0245d59dd710e.poster.avif?t=1738993046\" width=580 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/57e0746bd0544170b7a0245d59dd710e.webm?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2992340/extras/57e0746bd0544170b7a0245d59dd710e.mp4?t=1738993046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
